# Workspace-level env (Gen-16). Copy to `.env` and fill in.
#
# REQUIRED for live LLM grading:
#
# TANGLE_API_KEY — required for the rubric-quality LLM judge to call
#   the OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint. When absent, the
#   judge returns a structured `unmeasured` shape (score: NaN,
#   status: 'unmeasured') and aggregators in the loop SKIP it — never
#   averaging it in as a fake-zero. Set this to enable live grading.
#
# REQUIRED for the eval target:
#
# EVAL_TARGET_BASE_URL — the agent endpoint the eval runner POSTs at. Default
#   wires to http://localhost:3001 (the agent dev server). Override for
#   running against a deployed sandbox.
#
# OPTIONAL overrides (Gen-16.1 audit MED C2 — documenting hidden config):
#
# TANGLE_ROUTER_BASE_URL — override the router base URL. Default:
#   https://router.tangle.tools. Set when proxying through your own
#   gateway or pointing at a staging environment.
#
# RUBRIC_JUDGE_MODEL — override the LLM model the rubric judge calls.
#   Default: claude-sonnet-4-6. The model must be available at
#   TANGLE_ROUTER_BASE_URL via the OpenAI-compatible chat-completions
#   endpoint.

TANGLE_API_KEY=
EVAL_TARGET_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Optional overrides — uncomment + edit when needed.
# TANGLE_ROUTER_BASE_URL=https://router.tangle.tools
# RUBRIC_JUDGE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
